{"sections":[{"slug":"余骨架","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"余骨架"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">余骨架</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"余骨架"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $n\\geq -1$, <span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span> $X_\\bullet$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶余骨架</span> $\\operatorname{cosk}_n X_\\bullet$ <span lang=\"zh\">是满足如下条件的单纯集</span>:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}(\\operatorname{sk}_n Y,X)\\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}(Y,\\operatorname{cosk}_n X).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan复形","text":"Kan <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的余骨架是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Postnikov塔","text":"Postnikov <span lang=\"zh\">塔</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/数学对象的表现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模型</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\operatorname{cosk}_{-1}X=1$. (<span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $\\operatorname{sk}_{-1}Y=0$.)</li>\n<li>$\\operatorname{cosk}_0 X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $X_0\\to 1$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Cech脉","text":"Cech <span lang=\"zh\">脉</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $(\\operatorname{cosk}_0X)_n\\simeq X_0^{n+1}$.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>$n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶余骨架的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维及以上同伦群平凡</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}